  "description": "Jenesia, a brilliant sorcerer, was murdered after witnessing an affair between her fiancé and her best friend. With her final breath, Jenesia managed to use her magical powers to turn back time. Reliving her past, will Jenesia finally be able to find happiness?\n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)\n\n*Note: First released in English, with the initial eligible release in Japanese followed by Korean, making it a manga by our standards.*",
